; The typed bidirectional codec EDSL (docs/design.md §4.9.1, §6).
;
; Depends on foundation and nothing else. The hard constraint is negative and
; enforced by scripts/asm-check-layers.sh: nothing here may name or branch on a
; target. x86 vocabulary belongs in targets/x86_family, not in a generic
; combinator - a "generic" combinator named after one target is how a
; retargetable core stops being retargetable.

(library
 (name codec)
 (public_name rivet.codec)
 (modes byte native)
 (libraries foundation rivet_fmt)
 (enabled_if
  (<> %{env:RIVET_MELANGE=false} true)))
